 26-10-19T12:45:00-07:00@local-events
DESCRIPTION:With the 2026 midterm elections approaching\, join the America
 n Constitution Society (ACS) and the Election Law Student Association (ELS
 A) for a lunch talk on the evolving fight over voting rights\, election ad
 ministration\, and the integrity of American democracy. The discussion wil
 l explore current threats to voting access and fair representation\, the r
 ole of litigation and state officials in protecting elections\, and the le
 gal battles likely to shape the coming election cycle. \nOur speakers will
 \n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://law.stanford.edu/event/acs-presents-vo
